{
  "appid": 1446780,
  "name": "MONSTER HUNTER RISE",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "蓬勃跃动的狩猎本能！ 为狩猎掀起全新风潮、无拘无束尽情跃动的动作；可随心所欲四下驰骋的全新原野；以及能带来未知的兴奋与惊喜的全新怪物。 前所未有的狩猎体验正在《MONSTER HUNTER RISE》中等候各位猎人的到来！",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>有关追加内容（DLC）的贩售形式变动事宜</h1><p>由于汇率变动，在部分地区、货币中出现（或有可能出现）无法购买DLC套装商品的问题，<br>从2024年12月下旬开始，将随时变更在Steam上出售中的各种追加内容（DLC）套装商品的贩售形式。<br><br>內容：<br>现已取消“购买套装商品时，若用户的Steam库中已有套装内商品，会以差额购买不在用户steam库中的商品”的规则，<br>更改为“购买套装商品时，无论用户的Steam库中是否包含套装内商品，都必须一并购买整个套装商品”。<br>※ 请注意，单品DLC/套装商品有可能出现重复购买的情况。<br><br>部分指定套装商品的收录内容，以及商品图片和说明文会变更<br>部分指定套装商品的销售价格会有增减调整<br>部分指定套装商品结束贩售或暂停贩售</p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1>蓬勃跃动的狩猎本能！<br>为狩猎掀起全新风潮、无拘无束尽情跃动的动作；可随心所欲四下驰骋的全新原野；以及能带来未知的兴奋与惊喜的全新怪物。<br>前所未有的狩猎体验正在《MONSTER HUNTER RISE》中等候各位猎人的到来！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/c41217c5e723ba16429bc93e1d077469.poster.avif?t=1768870444\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/c41217c5e723ba16429bc93e1d077469.webm?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/c41217c5e723ba16429bc93e1d077469.mp4?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>・掀起全新风潮的“翔虫”动作</strong><br>“翔虫”会飞向猎人指示的方向，并使用特殊的“铁虫丝”将猎人拉近，让狩猎实现进一步的进化，配合各武器种类充满特色的攻击，诞生全新的狩猎动作！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/522768c21f965276d6d29c24c6f7d296.poster.avif?t=1768870444\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/522768c21f965276d6d29c24c6f7d296.webm?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/522768c21f965276d6d29c24c6f7d296.mp4?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>・操纵怪物的豪迈动作“御龙”</strong><br>操纵失控的怪物，使出豪迈的动作！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/e52bdb1223e8550db0c024fb1d45a6b4.poster.avif?t=1768870444\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/e52bdb1223e8550db0c024fb1d45a6b4.webm?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/e52bdb1223e8550db0c024fb1d45a6b4.mp4?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>・为狩猎提供帮助的随从</strong><br>除了老搭档“随从艾露猫”，还有全新的可靠同伴“随从牙猎犬”登场！<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/6189ed6e6acfe13613891fe325f66a09.poster.avif?t=1768870444\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/6189ed6e6acfe13613891fe325f66a09.webm?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446780/extras/6189ed6e6acfe13613891fe325f66a09.mp4?t=1768870444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>・炎火村的故事</strong><br>由于时隔50年的灾祸“百龙夜行”临近，炎火村陷入困境。<br>主角需以成为顶尖猎人为目标，同时与村庄中的同伴团结一致，共同克服这场可怕的灾祸。<br><br><strong>・大量怪物大举侵袭的“百龙夜行”</strong><br>百龙夜行，指由多只怪物与统领它们的首领组成“怪物群”向村庄发起的袭击。<br>整个地图到处都是大型怪物的身影……<br><strong><br>・拥有独特生态的怪物</strong><br>除象征本作的怪物“怨虎龙”外，还有拥有独特生态的未知怪物与系列怪物相继登场！",
